PaperLocal — third-party attribution registry
============================================

Bundled dependencies:

- pdf.js 3.11.174 (legacy build, pdf.min.js + pdf.worker.min.js) — MIT,
  https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js — bundled in
  app/src/main/assets/reader/pdfjs/

Planned:
- pdfium (alternative renderer) — BSD-3, https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/
- pdf2htmlEX (optional reflow pipeline) — MIT, https://github.com/coolwanglu/pdf2htmlEX

docs/PROTOCOL.md is an independent observation record of a public
client/server message flow (interoperability notes), not vendor code.
